{"title":"Career roadmap · FinTech Developer","role":"FinTech Developer","summary":"A FinTech Developer builds software for financial services such as digital payments, banking, lending, wealth management, insurance, financial analytics and regulatory technology. The role combines software engineering, databases, APIs, financial concepts, cybersecurity and data analytics.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Business Analytics / FinTech","Timeline assumption":"3-year BCA beginning in 2026 → graduation around 2029. For a 4-year honours structure, graduation would typically be around 2030."},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Direct"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BCA FinTech","Programming + SQL","Financial systems","APIs/payments","Security","FinTech projects","Internship","Junior FinTech Developer","FinTech Software Engineer","Senior Engineer"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2029/30"},{"text":"Build software engineering, databases, APIs, financial systems and cybersecurity fundamentals."}],[{"text":"2029–2034"},{"text":"Become a production FinTech engineer and specialise in payments, banking, lending, wealth-tech or risk technology."}],[{"text":"2034–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior FinTech Engineer, Technical Lead, Solutions Engineer or Financial Systems Architect."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Principal Engineer, FinTech Architect, Engineering Manager, Product/Technology Lead or financial-platform leadership."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Java/Python fundamentals"},{"text":"Coding portfolio"},{"text":"Programming"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"SQL + databases"},{"text":"DBMS, transactions"},{"text":"Banking database project"},{"text":"Data foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Web/backend"},{"text":"APIs, authentication"},{"text":"Financial REST API"},{"text":"Application development"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"FinTech fundamentals"},{"text":"Payments, banking, finance"},{"text":"Payment-system prototype"},{"text":"Domain knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Security + analytics"},{"text":"Encryption, fraud, risk"},{"text":"Fraud-detection project"},{"text":"Professional readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Internship + cloud"},{"text":"Docker, cloud, CI/CD"},{"text":"Deployed FinTech application"},{"text":"Job readiness"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced systems"},{"text":"Distributed systems, event-driven architecture"},{"text":"Transaction platform"},{"text":"Engineering depth"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Payments/wealth/lending/etc."},{"text":"Capstone + internship"},{"text":"Career differentiation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects to prioritise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Object-Oriented Programming"},{"text":"Data Structures & Algorithms"},{"text":"Database Management Systems"},{"text":"Computer Networks"},{"text":"Operating Systems"},{"text":"Software Engineering"},{"text":"Web Technologies"},{"text":"Financial Technology"},{"text":"Banking Fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial Markets"},{"text":"Accounting Fundamentals"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data Mining"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Cryptography"},{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Distributed Systems"},{"text":"API Development"},{"text":"Financial Risk Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Java"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"JavaScript/TypeScript"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Backend"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spring Boot"},{"text":"FastAPI"},{"text":"Node.js"},{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"Microservices fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Databases"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"MySQL"},{"text":"Redis"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"ACID concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech systems"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Payment APIs"},{"text":"Banking APIs"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"KYC workflow concepts"},{"text":"Transaction processing"},{"text":"Ledger systems"},{"text":"Fraud detection"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Notifications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Testing"},{"text":"Logging"},{"text":"Monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 6–8 serious FinTech projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital wallet prototype"},{"text":"Expense management application"},{"text":"Payment-processing simulation"},{"text":"Banking API"},{"text":"Loan-management platform"},{"text":"Fraud-detection system"},{"text":"Investment/portfolio dashboard"},{"text":"End-to-end FinTech capstone"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For every transaction-oriented project, demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorisation"},{"text":"Transaction IDs"},{"text":"Idempotency"},{"text":"Input validation"},{"text":"Database transactions"},{"text":"Audit logs"},{"text":"Error handling"},{"text":"Encryption/security concepts"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Never use real payment credentials or real financial data in student projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it lead